#: redi-restaurant-reservation.php:809
msgid ""
"ReDi Restaurant Reservation plugin could not get an API key from the reservationdiary.eu server when it activated.\n"
"                        <br/> You can try to fix this by going to the ReDi Restaurant Reservation \"options\" page.\n"
"                        <br/>This will cause ReDi Restaurant Reservation plugin to retry fetching an API key for you.\n"
"                        <br/>If you keep seeing this error it usually means that server where you host your web site can't connect to our reservationdiary.eu server.\n"
"                        <br/>You can try asking your WordPress host to allow your WordPress server to connect to api.reservationdiary.eu\n"
"                        <br/>In case you can not solve this problem yourself, please contact us directly by <a href=\"mailto:info@reservationdiary.eu\">info@reservationdiary.eu</a>"
msgstr ""
"El plugin ReDi Restaurant Reservation no pudo obtener una clave API del servidor de reservationdiary.eu cuando se activó.\n"
"                        <br/>Puedes intentar solucionarlo yendo a la página de «opciones» de ReDi Restaurant Reservation.\n"
"                        <br/>Esto hará que el plugin ReDi Restaurant Reservation vuelva a intentar obtener una clave API para ti.\n"
"                        <br/>Si sigues viendo este error, suele significar que el servidor donde alojas tu sitio web no puede conectarse a nuestro servidor reservationdiary.eu.\n"
"                        <br/>Puedes intentar pedir a tu host de WordPress que permita a tu servidor de WordPress conectarse a api.reservationdiary.eu\n"
"                        <br/>En caso de que no puedas resolver este problema por ti mismo, ponte en contacto con nosotros directamente por <a href=\"mailto:info@reservationdiary.eu\">info@reservationdiary.eu</a>"

